  {
    "name": "manage_scripts",
    "description": "Manages the LIFECYCLE of script and shader files: create, rename, move between folders, delete. Use this for any script/shader file-level operation. Does NOT edit script contents — to modify a script's source code, use text_editor. Commands: create: Creates one or more new Luau scripts or WGSL shaders, optionally seeded with content; rename: Renames one or more scripts/shaders by id or path (leaf name only — to relocate, use move); move: Moves one or more scripts/shaders to a target folder (missing folders are created); delete: Deletes one or more scripts/shaders.",
